INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` VALUES (7379,674,'description','<strong>In-season Performance Training</strong>\r\n\r\nIn-season performance training is difficult to prescribe in the gym due to players’ ages, minutes played, desire to lift heavy loads, and training goals. Arguably the #1 reason we train in-season is to reverse the effects of the sport, by decreasing injury and ensuring high performance come playoffs, when it matters most. Vasper fits both of these goals, allowing athletes to optimize their anabolic hormonal levels without additional wear and tear on tissues and joints through its concentric only approach. Vasper can lead to improved recovery, reduced chance of injury, and diminished fatigue by having a more optimal hormone profile which aids in tissue regeneration. \r\n\r\n<strong>Nutrition & Blood Profiles</strong>\r\n\r\nWe all know you must look under the hood once in a while to check for issues. Athletes’ blood work, hormonal profiles, nutrition, supplementation, workload monitoring, and sleep are all key components for human performance. Our staff ensures athletes can handle the rigors of elite sports, not just to prevent injury to thrive throughout the long grueling travel, training, and competition schedule. Vasper practices have been proven to enhance sleep, hormone profiles, blood work, and give athletes more energy.');
