INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` VALUES (12860,783,'quote_block_2_photo','711');
INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` VALUES (12861,783,'_quote_block_2_photo','field_5d8bdf4caaf49');
INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` VALUES (12862,783,'quote_block_2_quote','My first experience with Vasper was an eye opener. Within two minutes on the machine, I experienced a lactic acid burn that would normally require 20 minutes or more of high intensity exercise to achieve. The combined effects of the pressure cuffs and focused cooling while exercising stimulated me physiologically and mentally in ways that I had not experienced in months. When I left Vasper that day, I felt renewed, energized and wanting to return for more. The quality of my sleep has been excellent. My ability to manage stress and maintain peak level of productivity has been unsurpassed. Needless to say, I am a firm believer in Vasper as an integral part of a balanced workout regimen.');
INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` VALUES (12863,783,'_quote_block_2_quote','field_5d8bdf27aaf47');
INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` VALUES (12864,783,'quote_block_2_author','Lt Col Steve Butow 129OG/CD');
INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` VALUES (12865,783,'_quote_block_2_author','field_5d8bdf3daaf48');
INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` VALUES (12866,783,'quote_block_3_photo','711');
INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` VALUES (12867,783,'_quote_block_3_photo','field_5d8bdf4caaf49');
INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` VALUES (12868,783,'quote_block_3_quote','Upon leaving Vasper after the exercise, I was overwhelmed with a positive feeling and rush of endorphins. I slept well and without sleep aids, which is something that I have not done in years. During the evening after the exercise, I felt a sense of health and clarity and found myself amazed at the lack of fatigue or muscle soreness resulting from the Vasper session.');
INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` VALUES (12869,783,'_quote_block_3_quote','field_5d8bdf27aaf47');
INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` VALUES (12870,783,'quote_block_3_author','Peter Rojas');
INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` VALUES (12871,783,'_quote_block_3_author','field_5d8bdf3daaf48');
INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` VALUES (12872,783,'quote_block_4_photo','711');
INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` VALUES (12873,783,'_quote_block_4_photo','field_5d8bdf4caaf49');
INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` VALUES (12874,783,'quote_block_4_quote','I started the Vasper training program just a month ago. The results have been remarkable. In ten one half hour sessions I’m feeling more energy in my daily life and more endurance. The workout is invigorating, very different than traditional gym regimens. And I sleep soundly through the night.\r\n\r\nIn regard to to my Parkinson condition, I feel that the Vasper training system is fortifying my strength to cope with the symptoms of the disease. I am really looking forward to the next six to twelve months of Vasper assisted progress. I feel like I’ve been given a gift.');
INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` VALUES (12875,783,'_quote_block_4_quote','field_5d8bdf27aaf47');
INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` VALUES (12876,783,'quote_block_4_author','Lt Col Brian Foss 128ARRS');
INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` VALUES (12877,783,'_quote_block_4_author','field_5d8bdf3daaf48');
INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` VALUES (12878,784,'hero_title','UPGRADE  YOUR TRAINING');
INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` VALUES (12879,784,'_hero_title','field_5da786a8a7b24');
INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` VALUES (12880,784,'hero_text','At Vasper, we believe there’s a faster way to get an edge. In just 21 minutes, boost your anaerobic threshold and optimize your hormone balance for maximum strength and performance gains, all while avoiding the muscle and tissue damage that comes with over-training. Whether you’re an Olympic champion, a professional sports player, a cross-fit junkie, or fitness guru, Vasper can help you take your training to the next level.');
